  "prefLabel": "Puc 502.05 Landfill",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 502.05 “Landfill” means a facility which collects and disposes of waste by landfilling methods. The term includes facilities that collect and store waste indefinitely. The term does not include incinerators, land application sites, surface impoundments and injection wells.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Puc 500) #13794, eff 10-25-23",
